  "title": "Ex 4.19 · a² | b and b³ | c give a⁶ | c",
  "prompt": "Use a direct proof. Let $a, b, c$ be integers. Show that if $a^2 \\mid b$ and $b^3 \\mid c$, then $a^6 \\mid c$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
