  "hints": [
    "Write b as a²·(integer) and c as b³·(integer).",
    "Substitute your expression for b into your expression for c."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Since $a^2 \\mid b$, $b = a^2 j$; since $b^3 \\mid c$, $c = b^3 k$ (for integers $j, k$).",
    "$c = (a^2 j)^3 k = a^6 (j^3 k)$, and $j^3 k$ is an integer, so $a^6 \\mid c$. $\\blacksquare$"
  ],
